# LangGraph Refactoring Roadmap

`PhoneAgent` 使用 LangGraph StateGraph 实现 Plan-Execute-Reflect 拓扑，替代旧的 while 循环。

### Design Loop Status

```yaml
status: critic_approved
iteration: 4
last_planner_update: "Phase 5 Bugfix roadmap iteration 4 — fix action_confirmed unreachable in after_execute (CRITICAL-1), plan_node reset (MAJOR-1), confirm_node explicit return (MAJOR-2)"
last_architect_review: "Iteration 4: no blocking items. action_confirmed short-circuit position verified correct, consecutive sensitive ops safe, all paths self-consistent."
last_critic_verdict: APPROVE
approved_for_execution: true
notes: "Iteration 4 APPROVED after 4 Design Loop iterations. Non-blocking M-1 (pending_execute branch try/except) and M-2 (action_confirmed type annotation) to handle during implementation."
```

### 图拓扑

```
START → plan → execute → [confirm|takeover|reflect|replan|end]
                         ├─ confirm → after_interrupt → [execute|reflect|end]
                         ├─ takeover → after_interrupt → [reflect|end]
                         ├─ reflect → should_continue → [replan|end]
                         ├─ replan → plan (skip reflect for Wait/Note/Call_API/Interact)
                         └─ end → END
```

